    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/8d5c56fa329a12e5787ac926f484ea1b.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <i>fresh</i> and <i>exciting</i> <strong>competitive movement</strong> that challenges your coordination and athleticism. Play solo or with friends, learn and grow together to sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>Time Trials</strong> in many official and custom levels with varied difficulty, earn medals, and get your top spot on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/6857e8d40eea795d3ae1b3f7180f709f.avif?t=1751339066\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure how to complete a level? Load in <strong>ghost replays</strong> from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/c8df215d8c4643ed9851aad2b4bfd433.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <i>liberating</i> high speed, high skill ceiling, unique movement that offers players a broad range of mobility to get around in any environment. Creatively choose how to get from A to B, shake up the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.poster.avif?t=1751339066\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.webm?t=1751339066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.mp4?t=1751339066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your Quake/GoldSrc/Source experience to gain an edge ahead of the pack, or join the community and start learning fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/66a68578509eb677c1185ca8716d1efd.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in level editor, upload to workshop, subscribe and play with friends, edit existing workshop maps to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/8d5c56fa329a12e5787ac926f484ea1b.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <i>fresh</i> and <i>exciting</i> <strong>competitive movement</strong> that challenges your coordination and athleticism. Play solo or with friends, learn and grow together to sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>Time Trials</strong> in many official and custom levels with varied difficulty, earn medals, and get your top spot on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/6857e8d40eea795d3ae1b3f7180f709f.avif?t=1751339066\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure how to complete a level? Load in <strong>ghost replays</strong> from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/c8df215d8c4643ed9851aad2b4bfd433.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <i>liberating</i> high speed, high skill ceiling, unique movement that offers players a broad range of mobility to get around in any environment. Creatively choose how to get from A to B, shake up the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.poster.avif?t=1751339066\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.webm?t=1751339066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/914f8c842055ce17b777a783c97d1424.mp4?t=1751339066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your Quake/GoldSrc/Source experience to gain an edge ahead of the pack, or join the community and start learning fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414720/extras/66a68578509eb677c1185ca8716d1efd.avif?t=1751339066\" width=354 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in level editor, upload to workshop, subscribe and play with friends, edit existing workshop maps to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "PreStrafe is a fast paced, high skill ceiling, competitive movement parkour game with expansive and unforeseen meta where players compete for the best times on official and community levels. Play solo, with friends, or a public lobby.",
